    "enUS": {
      "description": "Ah, a {class}. I see great strength and determination in you--qualities necessary to rid these lands of evil.\r\n\r\nThe demons that walked these lands during the great battle were defeated, yet some still remain. It is important to prevent them from escaping.\r\n\r\nThe ruins to the east are dangerous. Carry your strength into their den. Destroy the unwelcome before our lands perish.",
      "dialogue": {
        "dd7218b3e287b1ba3fed": "You persevere.\n\nPerhaps regrowth begins anew."
      },
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
